          <zone id="1" type-v2="text" x="1500" y="1000" w="97000" h="8500">
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontname="Avenir Next" fontsize="27" bold="true" fontcolor="#24382c">VIRTUOSO  /  The data behind violin difficulty
</run>
              <run fontname="Avenir Next" fontsize="11" fontcolor="#59685c">Concerto corpus · 25 movements / 9 works / 6 composers · Experimental technical-demand index, not a validated difficulty grade</run>
